# "It deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life" (CR 608.2b): Bot2 Bolts its own Ornithopter in response to the enters trigger
# aimed at it, so the only target is illegal on resolution and the whole ability does nothing - Bot1 gains no life (the gain is part
# of the same instruction as the damage on a legal target, as the trigger is fizzled, not partly resolved). The sacrifice trigger still
# takes Phlage away.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Phlage, Titan of Fire's Fury
Lotus Petal
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Mountain x12

